{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EZ2ON REBOOT : R's second collaboration pack with HARDCORE TANO*C, a famous hardcore music crew in the rhythm game world, is now available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once again, you will feel maximum pleasure from the specially selected hardcore music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the second collaboration music pack DLC with HARDCORE TANO*C, &quot;HARDCORE TANO*C Music Pack Vol. 2&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It contains 10 songs and one exclusive panel and note skin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Songs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  1. <strong>Everybody Say HARDCORE TANO*C</strong> | by DJ Noriken </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  2. <strong>HiGHER</strong> | by\u00a0REDALiCE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  3. <strong>Skyriser</strong> <strong>(feat. Kanae Asaba)</strong> | by aran </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  4. <strong>Glitched Character\u00a0</strong>| by Kobaryo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  5. <strong>G.O.A.T.</strong> | by P*Light </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  6. <strong>Phalanx</strong> | by USAO </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  7. <strong>Bar Do Thos Grol</strong> | by Massive New Krew </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3  8. <strong>\u4ea1\u8005\u306e\u8e0a\u308a</strong> | by DJ Myosuke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3 9. <strong>Heimdall</strong> | by Gram</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3 10.\u00a0<strong>\u30b5\u30a4\u30af\u30eb\u30d2\u30c3\u30c8 (Cycle Hit)</strong> | by KASAI HARCORES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you own both the HARDCORE TANO*C Music Pack Vol.1 and Vol.2,  you can play the following track:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a3 <strong>Datamania (tpz Overheat Remix)</strong> | by t+pazolite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regardless of which 'TANO*C Music Pack' series you pur